<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P33/current/>
        rdf:type                skos:Collection;
        rdfs:comment            "Governance for vocabularies created for the European Marine Observation and Data Network (EMODnet) Physics infrastructure. EMODnet Physics is an upstream ocean data integrating service providing a single point of access to in situ ocean physics time-series data and vertical profiles, data products and metadata built with common standards, free of charge and no restrictions. The governance is loosely defined as the scientific expertise within the consortium with no formal processes defined.";
        rdfs:seeAlso            <https://github.com/nvs-vocabs/P33>;
        dc:alternative          "EMODnet physics themes/terms";
        dc:creator              "EMODnet Physics";
        dc:date                 "2026-07-23 03:00:01.0";
        dc:description          "Terms used by EMODnet physics to group parameters into coarser categories to be used at the data discovery and at the data aggregation product levels.";
